# Normalise line endings on the way in, and check out LF everywhere.
#
# Fixtures are inputs to the test suite and several assertions name exact line
# numbers, so their bytes have to be the same on Linux, macOS and Windows. A
# Windows clone with core.autocrlf=true would otherwise rewrite them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The lockfile is deliberately NOT marked `-diff` or `linguist-generated`.
# Marking it either way hides it from review, and a lockfile change is exactly
# what a dependency or supply-chain review needs to see.
